(6346477, 939415, 124982, '<td valign="top">This will be a difficult entry to vote on. The idea is great, very gritty and powerful. The execution though, I''m on the line though. Don''t mind the heavy highlights, but there just so little detail left. No details in the hair, the hands etc. Wish there was a little more definition.</td>', 'This will be a difficult entry to vote on. The idea is great, very gritty and powerful. The execution though, I''m on the line though. Don''t mind the heavy highlights, but there just so little detail left. No details in the hair, the hands etc. Wish there was a little more definition.', '2011-03-09 07:38:48.000000', NULL, 1),
