(6346538, 939732, 15711, '<td valign="top">This looks like a Starbucks ad.  My only nit would be the bur in the lower left. Oh, and straighten the "horizon" a smidge.  It''s slightly tilted to the right. :)</td>', 'This looks like a Starbucks ad.  My only nit would be the bur in the lower left. Oh, and straighten the "horizon" a smidge.  It''s slightly tilted to the right. :)', '2011-03-09 08:35:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(6346543, 939621, 15711, '<td valign="top">Nice low key.  I''m such a fan of blinds.  This is a good use of low key.  Kind of like the view of the person pouring the coffee, not quite ready to open the blinds and bring in the bright light to their sleepy eyes. :)</td>', 'Nice low key.  I''m such a fan of blinds.  This is a good use of low key.  Kind of like the view of the person pouring the coffee, not quite ready to open the blinds and bring in the bright light to their sleepy eyes. :)', '2011-03-09 08:36:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(6346545, 939525, 15711, '<td valign="top">WOW - how hard did you work to get that?  Love the agapanthus leaves.  Or are they laurel?  LOL I might''ve included a bit more of negative space beneath the spoon so that it''s the same as at the top of the cup.</td>', 'WOW - how hard did you work to get that?  Love the agapanthus leaves.  Or are they laurel?  LOL I might''ve included a bit more of negative space beneath the spoon so that it''s the same as at the top of the cup.', '2011-03-09 08:37:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(6346549, 938913, 15711, '<td valign="top">This is fun.  I like that unexpected chartreuse color of the wall. :) Looks like ad copy for a coffee shop or coffee company.</td>', 'This is fun.  I like that unexpected chartreuse color of the wall. :) Looks like ad copy for a coffee shop or coffee company.', '2011-03-09 08:38:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(6346562, 939753, 15711, '<td valign="top">Perfect focus.  Excellent composition and light even though the pattern is slightly distracting, but no big deal. I love his little "hands." :) It made me smile.  Oh and the catch light is terrific.  8</td>', 'Perfect focus.  Excellent composition and light even though the pattern is slightly distracting, but no big deal. I love his little "hands." :) It made me smile.  Oh and the catch light is terrific.  8', '2011-03-09 08:42:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(6346566, 939298, 15711, '<td valign="top">Is that a velvet backdrop?  I can see a bit of it''s texture.  Maybe bringing up the shadow tones a touch in levels would have fixed it.  Fun idea.  Fly away cup LOL</td>', 'Is that a velvet backdrop?  I can see a bit of it''s texture.  Maybe bringing up the shadow tones a touch in levels would have fixed it.  Fun idea.  Fly away cup LOL', '2011-03-09 08:43:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(6346568, 939198, 15711, '<td valign="top">I like the graphic sense.  Looks like advertising copy for a coffee company or a local bistro.</td>', 'I like the graphic sense.  Looks like advertising copy for a coffee company or a local bistro.', '2011-03-09 08:43:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(6346572, 939773, 15711, '<td valign="top">Cute idea but with so much in the background and the face on the cup, it is a bit busy. I would have loved a solid background. :)</td>', 'Cute idea but with so much in the background and the face on the cup, it is a bit busy. I would have loved a solid background. :)', '2011-03-09 08:44:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(6346575, 939713, 15711, '<td valign="top">It has a pink tint to it.  Just a nit pick but I would have done selective color (red/magenta - legal in basic) and toned it down a smidge.  Love the steam rising off of the cup.</td>', 'It has a pink tint to it.  Just a nit pick but I would have done selective color (red/magenta - legal in basic) and toned it down a smidge.  Love the steam rising off of the cup.', '2011-03-09 08:45:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(6346579, 939765, 15711, '<td valign="top">I think the lettering on the jacket is a touch distracting.  Maybe remove the silverware and napkin as they kind of overlap and confuse the eye a bit. But the dof and focus are spot on.</td>', 'I think the lettering on the jacket is a touch distracting.  Maybe remove the silverware and napkin as they kind of overlap and confuse the eye a bit. But the dof and focus are spot on.', '2011-03-09 08:46:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(6346582, 939767, 15711, '<td valign="top">An early St. Patty''s celebration. LOL  Not a huge fan of the border. :)</td>', 'An early St. Patty''s celebration. LOL  Not a huge fan of the border. :)', '2011-03-09 08:47:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(6346588, 939691, 15711, '<td valign="top">I would have had the negative space at the top the same distance as the bottom below the rim of the saucer (or crop the bottom, making it more square).  Nice focus.  I love the design on the upper most cup.</td>', 'I would have had the negative space at the top the same distance as the bottom below the rim of the saucer (or crop the bottom, making it more square).  Nice focus.  I love the design on the upper most cup.', '2011-03-09 08:48:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(6346594, 939304, 15711, '<td valign="top">Oh the lip print is a nice touch.  I think the scone/pastry is a touch unnecessary.  It kind of distracts the eye. A touch tight on the side crop. :)</td>', 'Oh the lip print is a nice touch.  I think the scone/pastry is a touch unnecessary.  It kind of distracts the eye. A touch tight on the side crop. :)', '2011-03-09 08:49:33.000000', NULL, 1),
