(6346950, 939525, 91783, '<td valign="top">that is really good coffee art! wow. nice job to who ever did it!  If i''m guessing correctly, you did this mainly with natural light? it looks nice but it gives away the wrinkles in the black material. just something to watch for next time. also the reflection of the lights up above are kinda distracting. maybe, if its at home you could a sheet or the rest of the black material hanging behid or to the left of the cup.<br/> <br/>This is all suggestion :) and good luck.</td>', 'that is really good coffee art! wow. nice job to who ever did it!  If i''m guessing correctly, you did this mainly with natural light? it looks nice but it gives away the wrinkles in the black material. just something to watch for next time. also the reflection of the lights up above are kinda distracting. maybe, if its at home you could a sheet or the rest of the black material hanging behid or to the left of the cup. This is all suggestion :) and good luck.', '2011-03-09 13:16:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(6346954, 939496, 91783, '<td valign="top">This reminds me of <img alt="'' . substr(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21.gif'', strrpos(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21.gif'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21.gif"/> <a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/profile.php?USER_ID=69325" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">smardaz</a>''s <a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=628977" rel="nofollow" target="_blank"><img alt="'' . substr(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_challenge/0-999/797/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_628977.jpg'', strrpos(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_challenge/0-999/797/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_628977.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//images.dpchallenge.com/images_challenge/0-999/797/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_628977.jpg"/></a>. I think you did a good job of making this look like an actual prescription. dof is good. although i think that the main subject could be a little sharper.</td>', 'This reminds me of  smardaz''s . I think you did a good job of making this look like an actual prescription. dof is good. although i think that the main subject could be a little sharper.', '2011-03-09 13:21:04.000000', NULL, 1),
