(6347500, 939434, 124256, '<td valign="top">I love it and recognize it well.  Great fit for the challenge.  The only thing is I can''t identify what''s in the reflection, and after noticing it the image in the reflection becomes pretty dominant (especially as it is ruthlessly repeated).  I think if the reflection showed coffee beans or a coffee maker or something that tied it all together it would be a 10.</td>', 'I love it and recognize it well.  Great fit for the challenge.  The only thing is I can''t identify what''s in the reflection, and after noticing it the image in the reflection becomes pretty dominant (especially as it is ruthlessly repeated).  I think if the reflection showed coffee beans or a coffee maker or something that tied it all together it would be a 10.', '2011-03-09 23:44:47.000000', NULL, 1),
