(6348940, 939817, 105333, '<td valign="top">Love it!</td>', 'Love it!', '2011-03-11 17:21:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(6348941, 939298, 105333, '<td valign="top">Cute idea.  I just hate it when a poltergeist takes my coffee.</td>', 'Cute idea.  I just hate it when a poltergeist takes my coffee.', '2011-03-11 17:21:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(6348942, 939546, 105333, '<td valign="top">Very romantic.</td>', 'Very romantic.', '2011-03-11 17:22:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(6348943, 939128, 105333, '<td valign="top">A unique take on the challenge.</td>', 'A unique take on the challenge.', '2011-03-11 17:22:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(6348945, 939827, 105333, '<td valign="top">Too much plain white space.</td>', 'Too much plain white space.', '2011-03-11 17:23:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(6348946, 939459, 105333, '<td valign="top">Great shadow.</td>', 'Great shadow.', '2011-03-11 17:23:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(6348948, 939755, 105333, '<td valign="top">Adds a whole new meaning to hot coffee.</td>', 'Adds a whole new meaning to hot coffee.', '2011-03-11 17:23:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(6348949, 939733, 105333, '<td valign="top">Nice textures on the beans.</td>', 'Nice textures on the beans.', '2011-03-11 17:24:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(6348950, 939689, 105333, '<td valign="top">Wonderful.</td>', 'Wonderful.', '2011-03-11 17:24:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(6348951, 939778, 105333, '<td valign="top">I like how the colors complement one another.  The blue from the mug matching the text in the paper and the biscuits matching the mug.</td>', 'I like how the colors complement one another.  The blue from the mug matching the text in the paper and the biscuits matching the mug.', '2011-03-11 17:25:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(6348952, 939810, 105333, '<td valign="top">A closer crop on the mug would make this more powerful</td>', 'A closer crop on the mug would make this more powerful', '2011-03-11 17:25:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(6348954, 939591, 105333, '<td valign="top">Good composition.</td>', 'Good composition.', '2011-03-11 17:26:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(6349008, 939166, 87055, '<td valign="top">Nice exposure, but it is not exactly showing coffee.... seems to have anything hot in the cup.</td>', 'Nice exposure, but it is not exactly showing coffee.... seems to have anything hot in the cup.', '2011-03-11 19:01:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(6349011, 939771, 87055, '<td valign="top">concentration is more on the mug.....</td>', 'concentration is more on the mug.....', '2011-03-11 19:02:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(6349012, 938892, 87055, '<td valign="top">Lovely shot...</td>', 'Lovely shot...', '2011-03-11 19:03:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(6349013, 939434, 87055, '<td valign="top">The brim is really interesting</td>', 'The brim is really interesting', '2011-03-11 19:04:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(6349032, 939496, 124738, '<td valign="top">This composed shot expresses our desperation and dependence on coffee.</td>', 'This composed shot expresses our desperation and dependence on coffee.', '2011-03-11 19:38:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(6349035, 939817, 124738, '<td valign="top">Nice.</td>', 'Nice.', '2011-03-11 19:40:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(6349052, 939630, 3102, '<td valign="top">Very nicely done -- could pass as an advertisement.  I would expect this to ribbon.</td>', 'Very nicely done -- could pass as an advertisement.  I would expect this to ribbon.', '2011-03-11 19:53:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(6349130, 939625, 114225, '<td valign="top">Interesting dichotomy between the snow and mug. I think this photo could have been served well by reducing the exposure compensation to make sure fewer highlights were blown out. But the composition and overall effect are good.</td>', 'Interesting dichotomy between the snow and mug. I think this photo could have been served well by reducing the exposure compensation to make sure fewer highlights were blown out. But the composition and overall effect are good.', '2011-03-11 22:38:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(6349131, 939641, 114225, '<td valign="top">Interesting take on the challenge. Nice use of depth of field and placement.</td>', 'Interesting take on the challenge. Nice use of depth of field and placement.', '2011-03-11 22:38:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(6349132, 939813, 114225, '<td valign="top">Simple, yet effective. The diagonal lines on the table, combined with the placement/composition really make one''s eyes flow through the photo.</td>', 'Simple, yet effective. The diagonal lines on the table, combined with the placement/composition really make one''s eyes flow through the photo.', '2011-03-11 22:39:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(6349134, 939773, 114225, '<td valign="top">Very well done. Great job ensuring the background fits the theme of the cup, and the entire scene is lit very well.</td>', 'Very well done. Great job ensuring the background fits the theme of the cup, and the entire scene is lit very well.', '2011-03-11 22:40:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(6349135, 939211, 114225, '<td valign="top">A standard coffee style shot, but very well done. The lines, circles, and arcs form a very powerful image.</td>', 'A standard coffee style shot, but very well done. The lines, circles, and arcs form a very powerful image.', '2011-03-11 22:40:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(6349136, 939733, 114225, '<td valign="top">I can practically smell the beans. Great details.</td>', 'I can practically smell the beans. Great details.', '2011-03-11 22:41:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(6349137, 939525, 114225, '<td valign="top">Very cute. Am I the only one that sees a face in there?</td>', 'Very cute. Am I the only one that sees a face in there?', '2011-03-11 22:41:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(6349138, 939806, 114225, '<td valign="top">Ah, the hustle and bustle. Great capture with movement and room for the main subject to walk into.</td>', 'Ah, the hustle and bustle. Great capture with movement and room for the main subject to walk into.', '2011-03-11 22:42:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(6349139, 939713, 114225, '<td valign="top">Very nice job with the steam. Interesting choice of color cast. Not sure I would have chosen carnation (I don''t know if that is really a name of a color), but it seems to work alright.</td>', 'Very nice job with the steam. Interesting choice of color cast. Not sure I would have chosen carnation (I don''t know if that is really a name of a color), but it seems to work alright.', '2011-03-11 22:43:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(6349140, 939454, 114225, '<td valign="top">Great historic based photo. the colors and grit are spot on.</td>', 'Great historic based photo. the colors and grit are spot on.', '2011-03-11 22:44:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(6349142, 939731, 114225, '<td valign="top">Great lighting and mood to this photograph. The steam is an integral part of setting this up.</td>', 'Great lighting and mood to this photograph. The steam is an integral part of setting this up.', '2011-03-11 22:45:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(6349143, 939799, 114225, '<td valign="top">I like how your lighting. It''s either the sun rising over the horizon, or a great simulation of that event.<br/>What is the coffee alternative?</td>', 'I like how your lighting. It''s either the sun rising over the horizon, or a great simulation of that event.What is the coffee alternative?', '2011-03-11 22:47:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(6349145, 939568, 114225, '<td valign="top">DNMC!!! You call that stuff coffee?? :-D<br/> <br/>All kidding aside, nice depth of field and I like the early morning style lighting. I do wish the main subject didn''t have such harsh reflections.</td>', 'DNMC!!! You call that stuff coffee?? :-D All kidding aside, nice depth of field and I like the early morning style lighting. I do wish the main subject didn''t have such harsh reflections.', '2011-03-11 22:49:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(6349146, 939681, 114225, '<td valign="top">Nice clean lines in this shot. I really like how the color goes from dark to white as you move up to the drop.</td>', 'Nice clean lines in this shot. I really like how the color goes from dark to white as you move up to the drop.', '2011-03-11 22:50:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(6349147, 939778, 114225, '<td valign="top">Overall, a good idea. I would like to mention some things that could make this a better photo:<br/>* Seems like you may have used on camera flash. Notice how that gives very harsh shadows and flattens out the image? Try finding a way to light the scene without that.<br/>* There is some sort of shadow in the bottom/middle of the photograph which is very distracting. Watch out for unwanted shadows and highlights.<br/>* The pen while nicely angled, is simply clutter in my eyes. I think I would remove it or replace it with a fancier pen.<br/> <br/>I hope these tips help!</td>', 'Overall, a good idea. I would like to mention some things that could make this a better photo:* Seems like you may have used on camera flash. Notice how that gives very harsh shadows and flattens out the image? Try finding a way to light the scene without that.* There is some sort of shadow in the bottom/middle of the photograph which is very distracting. Watch out for unwanted shadows and highlights.* The pen while nicely angled, is simply clutter in my eyes. I think I would remove it or replace it with a fancier pen. I hope these tips help!', '2011-03-11 22:53:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(6349149, 939803, 114225, '<td valign="top">I like the sparse bean placement. Keeps the photo simple while adding interest. I do wish there were a bit less noise in the photo.</td>', 'I like the sparse bean placement. Keeps the photo simple while adding interest. I do wish there were a bit less noise in the photo.', '2011-03-11 22:54:44.000000', NULL, 1),
