(6351613, 939810, 129677, '<td valign="top">Nice work on the coffee explosion. But the rest of the picture I don''t particularly like. What''s those balckish things in the background? Why this cup? And does a splash really make better coffee?</td>', 'Nice work on the coffee explosion. But the rest of the picture I don''t particularly like. What''s those balckish things in the background? Why this cup? And does a splash really make better coffee?', '2011-03-15 07:03:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(6351614, 939212, 129677, '<td valign="top">Mmmmm... Nice coffee. Nice high contrast too. I''m not sure about the shadow. But I like the coffee.</td>', 'Mmmmm... Nice coffee. Nice high contrast too. I''m not sure about the shadow. But I like the coffee.', '2011-03-15 07:04:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(6351615, 939792, 129677, '<td valign="top">I like your picture''s documentary style. I actually believe this woman really enjoys her coffee and comics and I find this a very enjoyable picture. Thanks :)</td>', 'I like your picture''s documentary style. I actually believe this woman really enjoys her coffee and comics and I find this a very enjoyable picture. Thanks :)', '2011-03-15 07:06:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(6351617, 939827, 129677, '<td valign="top">A white background is always a good move. But its cleanness reveals all the coffee dust that''s on your sheet. The picture is slightly askew too, which bugs me. And there''s just too much blurry beans. <br/> <br/>I would have liked this picture much better if you would have only photographed falling beans. Or made them fall into a huge pile of other beans, so that the whiteness would''ve only been in the background.</td>', 'A white background is always a good move. But its cleanness reveals all the coffee dust that''s on your sheet. The picture is slightly askew too, which bugs me. And there''s just too much blurry beans.  I would have liked this picture much better if you would have only photographed falling beans. Or made them fall into a huge pile of other beans, so that the whiteness would''ve only been in the background.', '2011-03-15 07:11:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(6351618, 939783, 129677, '<td valign="top">Hahaha. Now I want to know whose perfect cup of coffee this is :D Niceliy done though. <br/> <br/>There''s some reflections in the cup stealing my attention. You could try editing them away.</td>', 'Hahaha. Now I want to know whose perfect cup of coffee this is :D Niceliy done though.  There''s some reflections in the cup stealing my attention. You could try editing them away.', '2011-03-15 07:16:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(6351621, 939018, 129677, '<td valign="top">Nicely done picture. Though close, I can''t really see why this is a perfect cup of coffee. Your model''s eyes are a bit too vacant. She doesn''t really seem to enjoy this coffee moment. If her eyes would have smiled a bit, and if she would have hinted a look at the camera, I would have liked it better.</td>', 'Nicely done picture. Though close, I can''t really see why this is a perfect cup of coffee. Your model''s eyes are a bit too vacant. She doesn''t really seem to enjoy this coffee moment. If her eyes would have smiled a bit, and if she would have hinted a look at the camera, I would have liked it better.', '2011-03-15 07:20:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(6351622, 938913, 129677, '<td valign="top">Though I like the colour combination and the idea, those beans jsut seem a little too agressive. They''re catapulted into that coffee cup, not gently strewn. Did you try a shorter shutter time as well? And a bit higher a perspective? Then you''d better get that slow motion wowie feeling of a great cup of coffee I think you were looking for.</td>', 'Though I like the colour combination and the idea, those beans jsut seem a little too agressive. They''re catapulted into that coffee cup, not gently strewn. Did you try a shorter shutter time as well? And a bit higher a perspective? Then you''d better get that slow motion wowie feeling of a great cup of coffee I think you were looking for.', '2011-03-15 07:23:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(6351623, 939658, 129677, '<td valign="top">Yes, that cup is perfect.</td>', 'Yes, that cup is perfect.', '2011-03-15 07:24:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(6351624, 939773, 129677, '<td valign="top">What this picture does, is making me more interested in the surroundings of the coffee - including the cup - than of the coffee itself, which seems rather ordinary. And though the surroundings look amazingly desirable, it just doesn''t really add up.</td>', 'What this picture does, is making me more interested in the surroundings of the coffee - including the cup - than of the coffee itself, which seems rather ordinary. And though the surroundings look amazingly desirable, it just doesn''t really add up.', '2011-03-15 07:26:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(6351625, 939733, 129677, '<td valign="top">Really sharp, well composed picture, but a really cold one as well. I don''t feel much seeing this cup of coffee.</td>', 'Really sharp, well composed picture, but a really cold one as well. I don''t feel much seeing this cup of coffee.', '2011-03-15 07:28:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(6351627, 939630, 129677, '<td valign="top">Yes, I like. This woman, though very much posing for the picture, really enjoys that espresso. Good styling! Well done.</td>', 'Yes, I like. This woman, though very much posing for the picture, really enjoys that espresso. Good styling! Well done.', '2011-03-15 07:28:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(6351629, 939706, 129677, '<td valign="top">This picture puzzles me. What is that whine glass doing there? Why are all these things on an ironing board? For whom is that cup of coffee on the right? Who''s on a break from that computer? And why are there unused sticky notes in front of it? I can''t see the person, or persons, in which all these elements would logically combine. And that itches! :\</td>', 'This picture puzzles me. What is that whine glass doing there? Why are all these things on an ironing board? For whom is that cup of coffee on the right? Who''s on a break from that computer? And why are there unused sticky notes in front of it? I can''t see the person, or persons, in which all these elements would logically combine. And that itches! :\', '2011-03-15 07:32:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(6351630, 938989, 129677, '<td valign="top">Nice splash. But does it make a better cup of coffee?<br/>This is a technically well executed picture. But it doesn''t make me love it.</td>', 'Nice splash. But does it make a better cup of coffee?This is a technically well executed picture. But it doesn''t make me love it.', '2011-03-15 07:33:38.000000', NULL, 1),
