(6351643, 938980, 129677, '<td valign="top">To me it looks like a cigarette fell into that cup. I miss a hint of coffee in there. Or even better: coffee being poored in. Apart from that: well done picture.</td>', 'To me it looks like a cigarette fell into that cup. I miss a hint of coffee in there. Or even better: coffee being poored in. Apart from that: well done picture.', '2011-03-15 07:48:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(6351644, 939583, 129677, '<td valign="top">This coffee cup looks like it''s</td>', 'This coffee cup looks like it''s', '2011-03-15 07:49:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(6351645, 939326, 129677, '<td valign="top">Hmmm... This picture looks like... The person behind that newspaper is ignoring the fact that someone made them coffee. But really really ignoring it.<br/> <br/>Doesn''t make me think of it as a perfect cup of coffee. But more of a motive for a marital argument.<br/> <br/>An interesting picture it is though.</td>', 'Hmmm... This picture looks like... The person behind that newspaper is ignoring the fact that someone made them coffee. But really really ignoring it. Doesn''t make me think of it as a perfect cup of coffee. But more of a motive for a marital argument. An interesting picture it is though.', '2011-03-15 07:52:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(6351646, 938892, 129677, '<td valign="top">Very cute. A bit dark though. This picture could do with a little more lightness and contrast, I think.</td>', 'Very cute. A bit dark though. This picture could do with a little more lightness and contrast, I think.', '2011-03-15 07:53:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(6351647, 939803, 129677, '<td valign="top">Ooohhh. Magazine contentish. Nice!</td>', 'Ooohhh. Magazine contentish. Nice!', '2011-03-15 07:55:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(6351651, 939721, 129677, '<td valign="top">Somehow all those different materials and textures annoy me. The glass measuring cup, the wood finish, the porcelain saucer, the plastered wall... And they annoy me because the picture is composed in such a way that my attention - after having eyed the strange combination of coffee in such a cup - can only go to those textures. But the textures aren''t that much interesting either. So... it itches. And I think it would have been more interesting to me if you''d experimented more with lighting effects and composition. So that there''s more to look at.</td>', 'Somehow all those different materials and textures annoy me. The glass measuring cup, the wood finish, the porcelain saucer, the plastered wall... And they annoy me because the picture is composed in such a way that my attention - after having eyed the strange combination of coffee in such a cup - can only go to those textures. But the textures aren''t that much interesting either. So... it itches. And I think it would have been more interesting to me if you''d experimented more with lighting effects and composition. So that there''s more to look at.', '2011-03-15 08:02:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(6351653, 939684, 129677, '<td valign="top">Mmmm. Nice cup of coffee. But I can''t help to feel a bit funny about it standing of a piece of paper so near the edge of the table. Makes me want to pull that paper, really. But that''s just me.<br/> <br/>Nice detail, putting those two ther cups in the background.</td>', 'Mmmm. Nice cup of coffee. But I can''t help to feel a bit funny about it standing of a piece of paper so near the edge of the table. Makes me want to pull that paper, really. But that''s just me. Nice detail, putting those two ther cups in the background.', '2011-03-15 08:06:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(6351654, 939732, 129677, '<td valign="top">Wow.</td>', 'Wow.', '2011-03-15 08:06:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(6351655, 938950, 129677, '<td valign="top">Mmmm... I really can imagine she is enjoying this moment, but I see just a bit too little of her face to /know/ she does. If the light would have struck just a bit more of her mouth, just a glimpse of her eyes, the picture would be stronger, in my opinion. Nice work, nonetheless!</td>', 'Mmmm... I really can imagine she is enjoying this moment, but I see just a bit too little of her face to /know/ she does. If the light would have struck just a bit more of her mouth, just a glimpse of her eyes, the picture would be stronger, in my opinion. Nice work, nonetheless!', '2011-03-15 08:08:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(6351656, 939166, 129677, '<td valign="top">Now /there/''s someone  you''d like sharing a biscuit with! A nice and playful image. I like the cup too, and the contrast it makes with the darker sweater. Would like to have seen just a little bit more of the young man''s mouth though. But well done!</td>', 'Now /there/''s someone  you''d like sharing a biscuit with! A nice and playful image. I like the cup too, and the contrast it makes with the darker sweater. Would like to have seen just a little bit more of the young man''s mouth though. But well done!', '2011-03-15 08:08:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(6351657, 939568, 129677, '<td valign="top">The cup of coffee you drink before putting on your glasses? :)</td>', 'The cup of coffee you drink before putting on your glasses? :)', '2011-03-15 08:08:51.000000', NULL, 1),
